WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.837
Chapter One.

00:00:01.787 --> 00:00:04.087
The Exterminator Vector.

00:00:04.087 --> 00:00:09.975
46 currently sitting Members of Parliament voted to legalise and then expand MAID.

00:00:09.975 --> 00:00:16.962
A 16.8 times increase in state-administered deaths between 2016 and 2024.

00:00:16.962 --> 00:00:19.187
Zero abstentions.

00:00:19.187 --> 00:00:21.175
Zero dissents.

00:00:21.175 --> 00:00:24.787
They operated with full knowledge of UN warnings.

00:00:24.787 --> 00:00:27.412
They remain in their seats of power.

00:00:27.412 --> 00:00:31.112
76,707 dead.
